<navigation-bar title="评估说明" warmSwiss="{{true}}" back="{{backEnabled}}" fallbackUrl="/pages/home/index" fallbackIsTab="{{true}}" color="#111827" background="#FBFAF7" bind:navigationfail="onNavigationFailure"></navigation-bar>
<page-container extraClass="assessment-page">
  <view class="intro-page">
    <view class="intro-hero">
      <text class="intro-title">先花几分钟，\n了解老人的真实需求。</text>
      <text class="intro-description">回答一些关于老人生活与照护情况的问题，帮助我们整理更清晰的养老需求。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="intro-section">
      <view class="ws-section-heading"><text class="ws-section-number">01</text><text>评估会了解什么</text></view>
      <view class="overview-list">
        <view wx:for="{{overviewItems}}" wx:key="index" class="overview-item">
          <text class="overview-title">{{item.title}}</text>
          <text class="overview-description">{{item.description}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="intro-section">
      <view class="ws-section-heading"><text class="ws-section-number">02</text><text>大约需要多久</text></view>
      <view class="intro-section-copy">
        <text class="intro-duration">3–5 <text class="intro-duration-unit">分钟</text></text>
        <text class="intro-note">评估分为多个小步骤，可以按自己的节奏填写，也可以分次完成。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="intro-section">
      <view class="ws-section-heading"><text class="ws-section-number">03</text><text>不确定也可以继续</text></view>
      <view class="intro-section-copy">
        <text class="intro-copy-title">不清楚也没关系，部分问题可以选择“暂不确定”。</text>
        <text class="intro-note">未知信息会被保留，不会被当作“没有需求”。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="intro-section">
      <view class="ws-section-heading"><text class="ws-section-number">04</text><text>信息怎么使用</text></view>
      <view class="intro-section-copy">
        <view class="intro-flow"><text>评估信息</text><text class="intro-flow-arrow">→</text><text>老人需求画像</text><text class="intro-flow-arrow">→</text><text>机构匹配参考</text></view>
        <text class="intro-note">老人健康与照护信息仅用于养老需求评估、机构匹配与服务对接，不是医疗诊断。</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{hasDraft}}" class="draft-banner">
      <text class="draft-title">发现一份未完成的评估</text>
      <text class="draft-message">{{savedAtLabel}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="intro-actions">
      <primary-button wx:if="{{!hasDraft}}" warmSwiss="{{true}}" text="开始评估 →" bind:action="startAssessment"></primary-button>
      <button wx:if="{{hasDraft && !draftRecoveryRequired}}" class="draft-continue" bindtap="startAssessment">继续填写 →</button>
      <button wx:if="{{hasDraft}}" class="restart-button" bindtap="restartAssessment">重新开始</button>
      <view wx:if="{{restartError}}" class="restart-error">{{restartError}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</page-container>
